  ('making-peace-with-money', 1, 'Open your bank app or website and look at one balance for ten seconds. Then close it. That is the whole task.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 2, 'Write down the feeling that showed up when you thought about checking your money today, in one word.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 3, 'Look at the last three transactions on your main account and say each one out loud, without judging any of them.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 4, 'Find the due date of one bill and write it on a calendar you actually look at.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 5, 'Pick one subscription you pay for and decide, calmly, whether you still use it. No need to cancel yet.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 6, 'Put your unopened mail in one pile and open just the top envelope.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 7, 'Move one dollar, or whatever small amount feels easy, into savings and notice that it was possible.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 8, 'Tell one person you trust, "I am trying to get more comfortable looking at my money." Nothing more is needed.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 9, 'Take three slow breaths before you open any banking app today, and notice whether the dread shrinks a little.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 10, 'Write down the earliest memory you have of money. Just the facts of it, a sentence or two.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 11, 'Check whether your checking account charges a monthly fee. If you are not sure, write the question down for later.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 12, 'Before you buy anything today, pause for one breath and ask, "Do I want this, or do I want the feeling?"'),
