  ('making-peace-with-money', 17, 'Set a five-minute timer and sort your receipts, paper or digital, into keep and toss. Stop when the timer ends.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 18, 'Count the cash in your wallet or pocket and know the number for today.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 19, 'Spend two minutes writing what you would do with an unexpected hundred dollars. Notice what that reveals about what you want.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 20, 'Choose one meal or coffee this week to make at home, and put the money you did not spend somewhere you can see it.'),
  ('making-peace-with-money', 21, 'Notice one money thought that runs on repeat, and write it down word for word so you can look at it instead of hearing it.'),
